#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.desktop:2 data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:6
msgid "Phodder"
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.desktop:3
msgid "Listen to podcasts"
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.desktop:9
msgid "podcast;rss;feed;episode;gpodder;"
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:7
msgid "A podcast player for Phosh"
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:9
msgid ""
"Phodder subscribes to podcasts, downloads new episodes in the background and "
"plays them from a queue ordered by group."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:14
msgid "Groups put daily shows ahead of the rest"
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:15
msgid "Download filters and automatic chapter skipping per podcast"
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:16
msgid "Sync with Nextcloud GPodder Sync"
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:17
#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:137
msgid "Pauses for calls and resumes when Bluetooth reconnects"
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:21
msgid "Phodder contributors"
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:49
msgid ""
"The desktop's list of background apps shows what Phodder is playing and "
"whether it's checking for or downloading episodes."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:56
msgid ""
"Playback speed is set with a slider, in steps of 0.25×, in the player and "
"for a podcast's own speed."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:63
msgid ""
"In Library, selecting episodes counts and acts on only the episodes the "
"current filter shows."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:64
msgid ""
"A podcast's Episodes tab can select one page or every episode, and "
"selections on other pages count."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:65
msgid "Downloading more than 20 selected episodes asks first."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:72
msgid "The Refresh button turns smoothly instead of wobbling."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:73
msgid "Playback resumes after a call you didn't answer."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:74
msgid ""
"Select several episodes at once to download, queue, mark, or delete them "
"together. Long press or right click an episode, or use the Select button."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:75
msgid ""
"Podcasts can have their own playback speed. Changing the speed while one "
"plays lasts for that episode."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:76
msgid "Trim silence shortens long pauses, for every podcast or only some."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:77
msgid "Back up your library to a file and restore it, from the main menu."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:78
msgid ""
"Play an episode before subscribing, from a podcast's preview in Add Podcast."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:79
msgid "Calls pause playback on every modem, including a second SIM."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:80
msgid "A sync problem's Details open Settings at the Sync section."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:87
msgid ""
"When the audio output isn't ready, such as a car still connecting, Phodder "
"tries the episode again instead of skipping to the next one."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:88
msgid "Switching off a car stereo pauses the episode instead of unloading it."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:89
msgid "The Refresh button turns while podcasts are refreshing."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:90
msgid ""
"Delete All Files in History works, says how many files it deleted, and is "
"unavailable when there's nothing to delete."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:91
msgid "Missing podcast and episode artwork is downloaded again."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:92
msgid ""
"A failing gPodder or Nextcloud sync shows in the problem bar until it works "
"again."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:93
msgid ""
"Playing with nothing loaded resumes the episode you were listening to, not "
"whatever is first in the queue."
msgstr ""

#: data/net.dunevent.Phodder.metainfo.xml:100
msgid ""
"Headset and media-key previous and next buttons skip back and forward; press "
